  "title": "关于移交2026年6月毕（结）业研究生档案相关材料的通知",
  "date": "20260622",
  "time": "2026-06-22 09:25",
  "category": "教务通知",
  "department": "研究生院",
  "sourceId": "tsinghua-info-all",
  "sourceName": "清华信息门户",
  "source": "清华信息门户",
  "sourceUrl": "https://info.tsinghua.edu.cn/f/info/xxfb_fg/xnzx/template/detail?xxid=d27f83b1d7e14974ae32c2bfda7fcbc8",
  "summary": "",
  "preview": "",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"margin-top:21px; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><font face=\"仿宋\">各院系：</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">为了保证</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">202</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">年</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">月</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">毕</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">结</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">业研究生的档案能够及时、准确地发送到用人单位，请各院系做好相关工作，及时将毕</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">结</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">业研究生档案相关材料移交至档案馆。相关安排如下：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><font face=\"黑体\">一、</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><font face=\"黑体\">归档</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><font face=\"黑体\">材料</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">1.</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">毕业</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">生材料</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">：档案证明</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">（</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\">2024</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">级</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">之前</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">）、</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">学位（毕业）审批材料</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">（</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">清单见附件</font><font face=\"仿宋\">1</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">）、</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">毕</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">业研究生登记表，毕业证书复印件，学位证书复印件等</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">结业生按照要求换发毕业证的，参照毕业生材料归档。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">2.结业生材料：档案证明（</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\">2024</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">级</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">之前）、成绩单、研究生结业审批表、毕业</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">研究生登记表</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">、</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">结业证书复印件、研究生结业申请审批表或研究生学位申请书（如两者都有，均归档）、学位论文答辩相关材料（如参加答辩，清单为附件</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\">1<font face=\"仿宋\">中的第</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">3</font><font face=\"仿宋\">～</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">7</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">项）等。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><font face=\"黑体\">二、移交程序</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">1.整理材料：</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">以上</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">归档材料应填写完整并加盖公章，</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">每位研究生的</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">全套材料</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">整理在一起</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">。</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">证书</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">复印相关说明见附件</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">2</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">2.材料排序：</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">毕业生材料在前、结业生材料放后，分别</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">按学号顺序从小到大排列。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">3.填写清单：档案材料</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">移交</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">清单见附件</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">3</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">4.移交档案：各院系核实无误后，将整理好的档案材料与纸质</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">移交</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">清单一起送交档案馆。电子版清单发至研究生院（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">luyuqi@tsinghua.edu.cn</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">）和档案馆（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">qhdag@tsinghua.edu.cn</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">），邮件标题</font><font face=\"仿宋\">“</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">XX<font face=\"仿宋\">院系</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">-202</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">年</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">月研</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">究生毕</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">结</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">业档案材料移交清单</font><font face=\"仿宋\">-日期”。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><font face=\"黑体\">三、注意事项</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">1.档案在学校的少数民族骨干计划委培定向生、全日制港澳台研究生的档案材料移交档案馆，少数民族骨干计划委培定向生需同时移交毕业证书、学位证书原件</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">2.其他委培定向生</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">、</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">非全日制生，</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">结业生</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">按照要求换发</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">毕业证</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">的</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">、毕业生申请补授学位</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">的</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">等档案不在学校的</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">研究生</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">，其毕（结）业材料和在校期间产生的档案材料，收集后装入档案袋，档案袋需密封并在封口处加盖公章，按档案接收单位要求进行寄送，原则上不得本人转交。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">3.自今年起，结业生材料按毕业批次统一移交。院系现存往期暂存材料，请尽快移交档案馆。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">4.党员材料按党委组织部统一要求整理和移交。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">5.国内深造毕业生拟就读学校开具的调档函不再需要移交纸质版，由毕业生本人按照学生职业发展中心要求填写上传。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">6.自</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\">2026<font face=\"仿宋\">年</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">6</font><font face=\"仿宋\">月</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">1</font><font face=\"仿宋\">日起，</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">档案转递方式由机要通道调整为中国邮政速递物流</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">（</font>EMS<font face=\"仿宋\">）</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">，详见档案馆通知。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><font face=\"黑体\">四、时间</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><font face=\"黑体\">地点</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">移交时间：</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">截止</font></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\">2026<font face=\"仿宋\">年</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">7</font><font face=\"仿宋\">月</font><font face=\"Times New Roman, Times, serif\">3</font><font face=\"仿宋\">日</font></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">。</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">因档案转递工作程序严格，为保证毕</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">（</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">结</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">业生档案的按时发送，请各</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">院系</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">将相关材料尽早移交档案馆。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">移交</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">地点</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">：</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">档案馆</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\">215<font face=\"仿宋\">房间，</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">田宁宁</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">（</font>62797880<font face=\"仿宋\">）</font></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><font face=\"黑体\">五、</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:黑体\"><font face=\"黑体\">联系方式</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">研究生院：卢宇奇</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">（</font>62775555<font face=\"仿宋\">）；研究生工作部：</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">张译匀</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">（</font>62792480<font face=\"仿宋\">）</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">附件</font><font face=\"仿宋\">1：学位（毕业）审批材料清单</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">附件</font><font face=\"仿宋\">2：证书复印相关说明</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:28.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"仿宋\">附件</font><font face=\"仿宋\">3：研究生毕（结）业档案材料移交清单</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:336.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">     研究生院</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:322.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><font face=\"仿宋\">     研究生工作部</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:308.0000pt; text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"line-height:25.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">             202</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">年</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">6</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">月</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\">22</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman'\"><font face=\"仿宋\">日</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n</div>",
  "contentText": "各院系： 为了保证 202 6 年 6 月 毕 （ 结 ） 业研究生的档案能够及时、准确地发送到用人单位，请各院系做好相关工作，及时将毕 （ 结 ） 业研究生档案相关材料移交至档案馆。相关安排如下： 一、 归档 材料 1. 毕业 生材料 ：档案证明 （ 2024 级 之前 ）、 学位（毕业）审批材料 （ 清单见附件 1 ）、 毕 业研究生登记表，毕业证书复印件，学位证书复印件等 。 结业生按照要求换发毕业证的，参照毕业生材料归档。 2.结业生材料：档案证明（ 2024 级 之前）、成绩单、研究生结业审批表、毕业 研究生登记表 、 结业证书复印件、研究生结业申请审批表或研究生学位申请书（如两者都有，均归档）、学位论文答辩相关材料（如参加答辩，清单为附件 1 中的第 3 ～ 7 项）等。 二、移交程序 1.整理材料： 以上 归档材料应填写完整并加盖公章， 每位研究生的 全套材料 整理在一起 。 证书 复印相关说明见附件 2 。 2.材料排序： 毕业生材料在前、结业生材料放后，分别 按学号顺序从小到大排列。 3.填写清单：档案材料 移交 清单见附件 3 。 4.移交档案：各院系核实无误后，将整理好的档案材料与纸质 移交 清单一起送交档案馆。电子版清单发至研究生院（ luyuqi@tsinghua.edu.cn ）和档案馆（ qhdag@tsinghua.edu.cn ），邮件标题 “ XX 院系 -202 6 年 6 月研 究生毕 （ 结 ） 业档案材料移交清单 -日期”。 三、注意事项 1.档案在学校的少数民族骨干计划委培定向生、全日制港澳台研究生的档案材料移交档案馆，少数民族骨干计划委培定向生需同时移交毕业证书、学位证书原件 。 2.其他委培定向生 、 非全日制生， 结业生 按照要求换发 毕业证 的 、毕业生申请补授学位 的 等档案不在学校的 研究生 ，其毕（结）业材料和在校期间产生的档案材料，收集后装入档案袋，档案袋需密封并在封口处加盖公章，按档案接收单位要求进行寄送，原则上不得本人转交。 3.自今年起，结业生材料按毕业批次统一移交。院系现存往期暂存材料，请尽快移交档案馆。 4.党员材料按党委组织部统一要求整理和移交。 5.国内深造毕业生拟就读学校开具的调档函不再需要移交纸质版，由毕业生本人按照学生职业发展中心要求填写上传。 6.自 2026 年 6 月 1 日起， 档案转递方式由机要通道调整为中国邮政速递物流 （ EMS ） ，详见档案馆通知。 四、时间 地点 移交时间： 截止 2026 年 7 月 3 日 。 因档案转递工作程序严格，为保证毕 （ 结 ） 业生档案的按时发送，请各 院系 将相关材料尽早移交档案馆。 移交 地点 ： 档案馆 215 房间， 田宁宁 （ 62797880 ） 。 五、 联系方式 研究生院：卢宇奇 （ 62775555 ）；研究生工作部： 张译匀 （ 62792480 ） 。 附件 1：学位（毕业）审批材料清单 附件 2：证书复印相关说明 附件 3：研究生毕（结）业档案材料移交清单 研究生院 研究生工作部 202 6 年 6 月 22 日",
